"Developer Mode is now available on your iPhone or iPad. Open Settings > Privacy & Security > Developer Mode, turn it on and tap Restart. After the restart, tap Turn On and enter your passcode. Poki Setup carries on by itself once it is on." = "iPhone 或 iPad 上已显示开发者模式选项。前往“设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式”，开启后轻点“重新启动”。重启后轻点“开启”并输入设备密码。开启后 Poki Setup 会自动继续。";
