"Pair the iPhone first." = "请先配对 iPhone。";
"Tap Trust on the iPhone, then enter its passcode." = "请在 iPhone 上轻点“信任”，然后输入设备密码。";
"The iPhone said Don't Trust. Unplug it, plug it in again and tap Trust." = "iPhone 上选择了“不信任”。请断开并重新连接，然后轻点“信任”。";
"Unlock the iPhone and try again." = "请解锁 iPhone，然后重试。";
"The iPhone no longer trusts this computer. Plug it in with a cable, unlock it and tap Trust, then try again." = "iPhone 不再信任这台电脑。请用数据线连接并解锁 iPhone，轻点“信任”，然后重试。";
"The iPhone no longer trusts this computer. Plug it in and tap Trust." = "iPhone 不再信任这台电脑。请重新连接并轻点“信任”。";
"The iPhone did not finish remote pairing in time. Unlock it, stay on the Home Screen and try again." = "iPhone 未在规定时间内完成远程配对。请解锁 iPhone 并停留在主屏幕，然后重试。";
"The developer disk image is already mounted." = "开发者磁盘映像已挂载。";
"Asking Apple to sign the image for this device" = "正在请求 Apple 为此设备签署开发者磁盘映像";
"Turn on Developer Mode on the iPhone first." = "请先在 iPhone 上开启开发者模式。";
"Unlock the iPhone or iPad, then try Developer Mode again. iOS only turns it on from an unlocked phone." = "请解锁 iPhone 或 iPad，然后重试。设备必须处于解锁状态才能开启开发者模式。";
"The device does not offer cryptexd. Turn on Developer Mode (Settings, Privacy and Security, Developer Mode), then try again." = "设备未提供 cryptexd。请前往“设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式”开启开发者模式，然后重试。";
"The iPhone did not accept the app's signature. Make sure this iPhone is registered on the Apple ID's team and Developer Mode is on, then try again." = "iPhone 未接受 App 签名。请确认这部 iPhone 已在 Apple 账户所属团队中注册，且已开启开发者模式，然后重试。";
"The installed Poki has a different application signing identity. Keep Poki installed to preserve its data, and update it using the original signing identity on the original computer." = "已安装的 Poki 使用了不同的 App 签名身份。请不要卸载 Poki，以免丢失数据。请在原来的电脑上使用原签名身份更新。";
"Poki is open on the device. Close it before updating, or let Poki Setup close it." = "设备上的 Poki 正在运行。请先关闭它再更新，或允许 Poki Setup 关闭它。";
"Sign in again. The verification step has expired." = "验证已过期，请重新登录。";
"Sign in with your Apple ID first." = "请先登录 Apple 账户。";
"Your Apple session has expired. Sign in again." = "Apple 登录会话已过期。请重新登录。";
"Apple no longer accepts this sign-in. Sign in again." = "Apple 不再接受此登录会话。请重新登录。";
"Apple did not accept this sign-in (error -22411). Sign in again." = "Apple 未接受此次登录（错误 -22411）。请重新登录。";
"Apple sent a verification code. Enter the 6-digit code to continue." = "Apple 已发送验证码。请输入 6 位验证码以继续。";
"Apple has had too many sign-in attempts or codes for this Apple Account. Wait about an hour before you sign in again, because each new try asks Apple for another code." = "此 Apple 账户的登录或验证码请求次数过多。请等待约一小时再登录，因为每次重试都会向 Apple 请求新验证码。";
"This Apple ID has no developer team. Open Xcode or developer.apple.com once with it to accept Apple's agreement, then try again." = "此 Apple 账户没有开发者团队。请先使用此账户打开 Xcode 或登录 developer.apple.com，接受 Apple 的协议后再重试。";
"This team already has its development certificate, made by another computer or app. Revoke it at developer.apple.com (Certificates) or in that app, then try again." = "此团队已有由其他电脑或 App 创建的开发证书。请在 developer.apple.com 的证书页面或原 App 中撤销该证书，然后重试。";
"Apple accepted the certificate request but has not listed the certificate yet. Try again in a minute; if it keeps happening, save a Support Bundle from Diagnostics." = "Apple 已接受证书请求，但还没有列出该证书。请等待一分钟后重试。如果问题仍然存在，请在“连接检查”中保存支持包。";
"No Beta releases are available. Try again later." = "目前没有可用的 Beta 版。请稍后重试。";
"No Beta release with an installable IPA is available. Try again later." = "目前没有包含可安装 IPA 的 Beta 版。请稍后重试。";
"R2 is unavailable. Using GitHub for this update." = "R2 暂不可用，改用 GitHub 获取此更新。";
"R2 is not configured in this build. Using GitHub." = "此构建未配置 R2，改用 GitHub。";
"R2 download was interrupted. Using GitHub." = "R2 下载中断，改用 GitHub。";
"Poki Setup cannot reach usbmuxd, which macOS starts when an iPhone is plugged in. Plug the iPhone in with a data cable and unlock it." = "Poki Setup 无法连接 macOS 在接入 iPhone 时启动的 usbmuxd 服务。请用数据线连接 iPhone 并解锁。";
"Poki Setup cannot reach the iPhone service. Install Apple Devices from the Microsoft Store (or iTunes from apple.com), then plug the iPhone in again." = "Poki Setup 无法连接 iPhone 服务。请从 Microsoft Store 安装 Apple 设备，或从 apple.com 安装 iTunes，然后重新连接 iPhone。";
"connecting to the iPhone's profile service" = "连接 iPhone 的描述文件服务";
"installing a provisioning profile" = "安装描述文件";
"installing Poki (unlock the iPhone, check it for a prompt, then try again)" = "安装 Poki";
"listing apps" = "读取 App 列表";
"App ID and profile for %@" = "正在为 %@ 设置 App ID 和描述文件";
"Poki %@ (%@) signed for %@" = "已为 %3$@ 签名 Poki %1$@（%2$@）";
"%@ (free, 7-day signing)" = "%@（免费团队，签名有效期 7 天）";
"%@ (paid)" = "%@（付费团队）";
"The Apple ID signed in is not on team %@ any more." = "当前登录的 Apple 账户已不属于 %@ 团队。";
"Remote pairing did not finish (%@). Poki can pair on the iPhone instead." = "远程配对未完成（%@）。Poki 可以改为在 iPhone 上配对。";
"Could not let the iPhone use this pairing over the network (%@); Poki may need to pair on the phone." = "无法让 iPhone 通过网络使用此配对（%@）。可能需要在 iPhone 上进行配对。";
"Could not write into Poki's container (%@); the QR hand-off below does it instead." = "无法写入 Poki 的容器（%@）。请改用下方的二维码传输。";
"Could not give Poki its signing identity (%@); renewals stay on this computer." = "无法将签名身份交给 Poki（%@）。请继续使用这台电脑续期。";
"Scan the code with the iPhone's Camera, or open %@ on the iPhone" = "请用 iPhone 相机扫描二维码，或在 iPhone 上打开 %@";
"The iPhone refused a provisioning profile: %@. On a free team the phone must be registered on the Apple ID; sign in again." = "iPhone 拒绝了描述文件：%@。使用免费团队时，必须将 iPhone 注册到该 Apple 账户。请重新登录。";
"Install failed: %@" = "安装失败：%@";
"signing failed: %@" = "签名失败：%@";
"%@ left out: a team profile cannot carry the packet-tunnel entitlement, so Poki uses your proxy app's loopback instead." = "已省略 %@。团队描述文件不支持数据包隧道权限，因此 Poki 将改用代理 App 的回环连接。";
"%@: signed without %@ (this team's profile does not carry it)" = "%1$@：签名未包含 %2$@，因为此团队的描述文件不支持该权限";
"Developer disk image not pre-seeded (%@); Poki downloads it itself." = "未预先写入开发者磁盘映像（%@）。Poki 会自行下载。";
"The developer disk image was not mounted from this computer (%@). Poki mounts it itself when it connects." = "这台电脑未能挂载开发者磁盘映像（%@）。Poki 会在连接时自行挂载。";
"Could not check whether Poki is running (%@). Updating anyway." = "无法检查 Poki 是否正在运行（%@）。更新会继续。";
"The test build is not available any more (%@). Renewing with the release instead." = "测试构建已不可用（%@）。改用发行版本续期。";
"Image build %@." = "映像构建版本 %@。";
"Replacing the certificate “%@” (serial %@), as you chose" = "正在按你的选择替换证书“%1$@”（序列号 %2$@）";
"%@ of %@ MB" = "%1$@ MB / %2$@ MB";
"The iPhone stopped answering while %@. Unplug it, plug it in again and unlock it, then try again." = "%@时，iPhone 停止响应。请断开并重新连接 iPhone，解锁后再重试。";
"%@ No Beta releases are available. Try again later." = "%@ 目前没有可用的 Beta 版。请稍后重试。";
